(7201993, 1108666, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the stripes become a bloody mess when they hit the bottle.<br/> <br/>You clearly focused on the background. I wonder what the shot would look like if you focused on the glasses, or went for deeper DoF to have both the glasses and the background in focus.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the stripes become a bloody mess when they hit the bottle. You clearly focused on the background. I wonder what the shot would look like if you focused on the glasses, or went for deeper DoF to have both the glasses and the background in focus.', '2014-04-11 11:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7201994, 1108642, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting.<br/> <br/>A bit underporcessed, IMO. Visible CA on the black stripes in the glass, yellowish cast on the whites on the right. Some uneven ligting in the left. Composition-wise, i would have preferred more straigh-on angle.</td>', 'Interesting. A bit underporcessed, IMO. Visible CA on the black stripes in the glass, yellowish cast on the whites on the right. Some uneven ligting in the left. Composition-wise, i would have preferred more straigh-on angle.', '2014-04-11 11:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7201996, 1108028, 163430, '<td valign="top">WOW! I love it. Love the idea, love the colors and the sharpness and the way yoou camouflaged the end of the spiral (it is a plastic spirally toy thingy, right?).<br/>If i have to find a remark, it''s the reflection if the light on the ball. the small radial lines are OK, the big one at 8 o''clock (inside the ball) bothers me. Probably couldn''t be avoided.</td>', 'WOW! I love it. Love the idea, love the colors and the sharpness and the way yoou camouflaged the end of the spiral (it is a plastic spirally toy thingy, right?).If i have to find a remark, it''s the reflection if the light on the ball. the small radial lines are OK, the big one at 8 o''clock (inside the ball) bothers me. Probably couldn''t be avoided.', '2014-04-11 11:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
