(7203377, 1108696, 161867, '<td valign="top">The geese really make this photo. Are they real? Having the foresight to have such a fast shutter speed for a photo like this to capture the moving geese is impressive. Well done.</td>', 'The geese really make this photo. Are they real? Having the foresight to have such a fast shutter speed for a photo like this to capture the moving geese is impressive. Well done.', '2014-04-14 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7203390, 1108713, 161867, '<td valign="top">This photo is dripping with Americana. I don''t think this is the kind of photo that will do well in this challenge, but I really love it. Maybe a tad overexposed on the right side of the frame. And I kind of wish that person wasn''t in the shot. But I still really love this one. I hope it does well.</td>', 'This photo is dripping with Americana. I don''t think this is the kind of photo that will do well in this challenge, but I really love it. Maybe a tad overexposed on the right side of the frame. And I kind of wish that person wasn''t in the shot. But I still really love this one. I hope it does well.', '2014-04-14 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7203393, 1108620, 161867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2014-04-14 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7203399, 1108335, 161867, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. The colors are great. Maybe could have used a graduated ND filter to make the sky a little darker or put your strap in front of the frame where the yellow lights were for a few seconds to kill some of that brightness. Actually, as I scroll down, I might like this photo more with the skyline completely cropped out and it just having the water. Either way, creative use of color to create the "stripes." I like it.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. The colors are great. Maybe could have used a graduated ND filter to make the sky a little darker or put your strap in front of the frame where the yellow lights were for a few seconds to kill some of that brightness. Actually, as I scroll down, I might like this photo more with the skyline completely cropped out and it just having the water. Either way, creative use of color to create the "stripes." I like it.', '2014-04-14 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
