(7204314, 1108623, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> Btw is he a feral, looks like his ear is tipped...if they do that there...? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is what I call Town of Cats, reference to <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruki_Murakami" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Haruki Murakami </a> literature (<a href="//www.newyorker.com/fiction/features/2011/09/05/110905fi_fiction_murakami?currentPage=all" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link</a>)<br/> <br/>There are about 20 cats that formed a small colony that is taken care by a gentleman in the village I live. When he saw me with a big camera he immediately produced a license showing that he is allowed to take care of them (ha!). He claimed he took all the cats to the vet where they were neutered and marked as such by tipping the ear. <br/> <br/>I told him I just love cats :)<br/> <br/>He also said that some some have left him some time ago and formed another colony somewhere down there...<br/> <br/>Here are some pics from the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=8759&amp;collection_id=41773" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"Town"</a>. I have more so I''ll post them some time.</td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: Btw is he a feral, looks like his ear is tipped...if they do that there...?   This is what I call Town of Cats, reference to Haruki Murakami  literature (link) There are about 20 cats that formed a small colony that is taken care by a gentleman in the village I live. When he saw me with a big camera he immediately produced a license showing that he is allowed to take care of them (ha!). He claimed he took all the cats to the vet where they were neutered and marked as such by tipping the ear.  I told him I just love cats :) He also said that some some have left him some time ago and formed another colony somewhere down there... Here are some pics from the "Town". I have more so I''ll post them some time.', '2014-04-16 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
